e verfügbar?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Ja, wir haben Kindersitze für verschiedene Altersgruppen. Bitte bei der Buchung angeben.\"}}]}"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"section-padding","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container space-y-12","children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-400","aria-label":"Breadcrumb","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/en","className":"hover:text-white","children":"Home"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"mx-2","children":"›"}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/en/kanton/schwyz","className":"hover:text-white","children":["Canton ","Schwyz"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"mx-2","children":"›"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-white","children":"Schwyz"}]]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"space-y-4 max-w-4xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-nova-gold","children":"Im Herzen der Urschweiz"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold text-white","children":"Taxiservice in Schwyz"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"tel:+41766113131","className":"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-nova-gold px-7 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-black hover:bg-nova-gold-soft transition-colors min-h-[48px]","data-testid":"phone-cta","children":"Book taxi: 076 611 31 31"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://wa.me/41766113131","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-600 px-7 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-green-500 transition-colors min-h-[48px]","data-testid":"whatsapp-cta","children":"WhatsApp"}]]}],[["$","section",null,{"className":"prose prose-invert max-w-none","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4","children":"Zuverlässiges Taxi in Schwyz"}],"$L3"]}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7"],"$L8","$L9"]}]}]],null,"$La"]}],"